nouveau-utils (2.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Release v2.3.0: Add opt-in dev-mode automatic wedged-GPU recovery (default: off).
  * Add nouveau-recover, nouveau-recover.service, and 99-nouveau-recover.rules for
    WEDGED=rebind uevents emitted by nouveau-dkms.
  * Expose recovery management via nouveau-ctrl recover [status|enable|disable|now]
    and nouveau-tui Telemetry tab / 'w' hotkey.

 -- Twilight0 <twilight0@vivaldi.net>  Fri, 27 Nov 2026 10:55:00 +0200

nouveau-utils (2.2.5-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Release v2.2.5: Fix post-S3 resume reclocking stall when debugfs pstate lacks '*'.
  * Remove truthy guard on get_current_pstate() in both manual lock and auto
    governor loops so nouveau-dynclockd re-applies target pstate after suspend/resume.

 -- Twilight0 <twilight0@vivaldi.net>  Tue, 24 Nov 2026 19:30:00 +0200

nouveau-utils (2.2.4-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Release v2.2.4: PCIe link protection, CRTC debugfs polling, and reclocking de-bounce.
  * Raise default INTERRUPT_THRESHOLD from 250 to 1000 IRQs/s to eliminate false-positive
    DDR3 memory reclocking and PCIe link renegotiation during continuous 2D desktop usage.
  * Query active CRTC modes via debugfs atomic state instead of polling /dev/dri/card0
    via libdrm, eliminating repetitive page table init/teardown and BAR1 flushes.
  * Add PCIe link protection: disable ASPM L0s/L1 transitions on GPU link and implement
    live config space self-healing to restore BARs, MSI, Command (0x0407), and rearm
    Fermi MSI latch (0x704) on bus reset.

 -- Twilight0 <twilight0@vivaldi.net>  Sun, 01 Nov 2026 23:00:00 +0200

nouveau-utils (2.2.3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Release v2.2.3: De-bounce interrupt load detection on 120Hz/144Hz displays.
  * Raise default INTERRUPT_THRESHOLD from 100 to 250 IRQs/s to eliminate false-positive
    3D boost triggers caused by high-refresh vertical blanking interrupts at idle.

 -- Twilight0 <twilight0@vivaldi.net>  Tue, 27 Oct 2026 16:00:00 +0200

